ion> noFunction </function>\n+      <env> .Map </env>\n+      <result> sVal(concatAcc(\"\", INPUT)) </result>\n+    </py>\n+endmodule\n*** End Patch")); | 019f8927-299c-72b0-a1fd-c6c6e8ea4fff
